WEBVTT

1
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:14,400
It’s either a mist that’s not that thick or that you can’t inhale.

2
00:00:24,060 --> 00:00:27,320
It has no effect on the skin or anything, it is harmless and wonderful

3
00:00:27,800 --> 00:00:43,660
It's only if you inhale it into the respiratory tract that it will kill you. I've tried it.

4
00:00:43,980 --> 00:00:45,620
This mist is fine for skin and things

5
00:00:45,900 --> 00:00:46,820
But never smoke it

6
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,940
Most likely it will be inhaled into the lungs and mucous membranes

7
00:00:49,420 --> 00:00:51,300
It is not clear which type of poison is poisonous
